'''Strait of Wings''' (羽根と歯車と黄金の岬, ''Hane to Haguruma to Ōgon no Misaki'', '''Cape of Feathers and Gears and Gold''') is the [[Builder's Blitz Stages|Builder's Blitz]] stage that features [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]], [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] and [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies. These stages have a chance to drop Feathers, Sprockets or Gold when cleared. This event was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]].

